[For "white"]
[Kind "sideline"]
[Start "scandi-nf6 3.d4"]
[Name "3...Qxd5: the queen after all"]

3... Qxd5 { Black takes with the queen after all. }
4. Nc3 { Hits her. After 4...Qd8 or 4...Qd6 as well, play Nf3, and you are in the lines you know. [%cal Gc3d5] }
4... Qa5 { The most common retreat. Nf3 next, and the game is in the 3...Qa5 lines. } *
